==English==

===Etymology===
Slang abbreviation of {{m|en|maximum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/mæks/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-max.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|æks|s=1}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|informal}} {{cap|maximum}}; [[maximal]].
#: {{ux|en|[[turn up|Turn up]] the volume to get the '''max''' effect.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|maxi}}

====Derived terms====
